  "expectedTestNames": [
    "legacy and explicit V2 windows are distinct exact schemas",
    "actual sequential stages charge ten F plus four P, and both Mac recoveries separately",
    "global reserve, real remaining work, ancestry and archival horizon cannot fund each other",
    "actual proposal wrapper clamps once to work end and rejects late, stale, reselected or beyond-horizon answers",
    "real pre-export caller refuses insufficient V2 recipe before exporter or seed path can run",
    "all real proposal call sites select P while finality, operations and withdrawals retain F",
    "profile rules determine the real325epoch lower bound and finite total budget",
    "synthetic action authority and two distinct roles are explicit",
    "pending identity joins publicKey ownership rather than index/null/keyEnv arithmetic",
    "observations do not coerce null and exit preparation enforces actual tenure",
    "withdrawal accounting uses exact selected debit and total withdrawal-step credit",
    "phase guards reject premature actions, repeated jobs and incomplete second restart",
    "single-validator adapter binds immutable state, exact decimal fields and lifecycle status",
    "only the freshly exported pending deposit and funded sender can be submitted",
    "exporter address boundary accepts casing of the same twenty bytes without changing the export",
    "exporter address boundary refuses malformed values and different address bytes on either side",
    "owner relocation remaps peer, core witness and all16 journal pairs without changing consensus or floors",
    "relocation refuses aliases, overlapping roots, changed domain/owner or an incomplete original journal mapping",
    "capture comparison preserves complete semantic commitments while physical copies have different inventories and config paths",
    "capture comparison refuses changed tokens, archives, signing history, owner and incomplete or writable role claims",
    "coordinator restores Native then DockerMac and binds each new proposal to the same duty beyond its cutoff",
    "coordinator refuses before later effects when a copy, finality, postcutoff proposal or required capability fails",
    "additional Mac recovery budget includes two restores and six full finality phases without changing existing audits",
    "actual Mac post-recovery proposal adapter refuses exact or late phase completion even while the global budget remains valid",
    "runtime and every specific private transfer authority fail closed before adapters",
    "plan hash comes from owned known bytes and retains independent artifact pins",
    "PREPARED is not acceptance; accepted projection cannot leak a session or fake finality",
    "operation commitment encodes actual public SSZ fields without private action export",
    "opaque known-file admission refuses post-admission mutation and physical aliases",
    "whole-owner copy plan refuses unsafe namespace, owner and zero inventory authority",
    "only terminal C++ replay closes accounting; 3 captures never mean 3 full audits",
    "stopped capture receipt retains real owner-local storage and only public commitments",
    "stopped capture receipt refuses missing authority, bad bindings and non-exact counters or flags",
    "stopped capture receipt requires all three distinct owners and rejects public extra fields",
    "stopped capture receipt is awaited and remains published when lifecycle closing fails",
    "stopped capture receipt publication refusal prevents closing and missing capture prevents publication",
    "each actual stopped capture commitment is awaited before return or a failed next stage",
    "retained stopped owner survives stage failure and all three captures publish before failed closing",
    "resuming invalidates the old stop before a new writer and cannot publish an incomplete terminal set",
    "retained stopped receipt refuses changed roots, duplicate or unhealthy owner authority",
    "whole-owner generated Perl copies complete namespaced roots and refuses copy mutation",
    "whole-owner statx keeps exact FD/path nine fields, one ns and closed ABI refusals",
    "candidate is accepted only after the actual common checkpoint was traversed; older canonical candidates also work",
    "same tip needs no block fetch; an extension joins the cursor without refetching old history",
    "rolling authenticated checkpoint refresh spans more than2048slots without larger windows and joins all refresh branches",
    "false common root, conflicting checkpoint or non-descendant finalized extension refuse without cache replacement",
    "parent loops, self parent, equal/reversed slots and unauthenticated projections cannot produce a candidate",
    "declared history byte and slot capacities fail distinctly from a searched deadline with no event",
    "absolute phase deadline refuses late header block callback result and sleep; Promise predicates never pass",
    "owner selection resolves all sixteen at one sealed state and chooses an actual finalized proposer independently of first key",
    "strict future duty floor is max stopped head and authenticated journal slot, never the signing root",
    "caller integration persists the exact decision before returning to STOP and shares one selection deadline",
    "actual lifecycle driver generation20261025 gates legacy and C8 authorizations and explicit closeout reserve before absent seed/output/network",
    "new output admission: actual save rejects transient ctime sample before stable first admission",
    "new output admission: three strict samples span two seconds and ctime change resets the run",
    "new output admission: every known-byte and creation-identity mismatch refuses without retry",
    "new output admission: retained inputs or outputs cannot be refreshed even during prospective sampling",
    "new output admission: ongoing ctime churn is bounded and unrelated read errors retain their identity"
  ],
